# Run records are the evidence docs/evaluation.md points at, so the JSON summaries are
# tracked. The per-document score arrays are tracked too: they are 36 KB each, and they
# are what lets anyone re-run the paired bootstrap and the McNemar test on a laptop
# without a GPU. Checkpoints, corpora and logs stay out.
*
!.gitkeep
!.gitignore
!*.json
!ood_scores_*.npz
*.pt
*.safetensors
*.log
